        "Content": "Detached three bedroom bungalow.\r\nSpacious and well proportioned accommodation throughout.\r\nGenerous surrounding gardens.\r\nLocated approximately 2km from Castlebridge, 7km from Wexford town and 7km from Curracloe Beach.\r\nExtending to approximately 164 sq. m (1,765 sq. ft).\r\nOn a site area extending to 0.25 hectares (0.61 acres).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a detached three bedroom house with gardens to the front and rear. The property is arranged over a single storey beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 164 sq. m (1,765 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
